  "scenario": "A marathon runner is considering an iPhone 11 Pro Max and wants protection against sweat and rain during repeated hot and humid training. The frozen material covers the phone's stated IP68 depth and duration, a second IP68 phone series with different conditions, the separate solid and liquid digits in IP ratings, sweat composition, generic corrosion conditions, four protection listings compatible with the iPhone 11 Pro Max, and four community discussions about deliberate water exposure, moisture, warranty, and cases. It does not contain a direct test of any exact phone-and-protection combination under runner sweat, rain, salts, repeated heat and humidity, or a complete marathon-training cycle.",
